    "# 🏆 MASTER CONTROLLED BENCHMARK: RAI v8.2 vs Real-Data Baselines\n",
    "### 0% Real Data Intake (RAI v8.2) vs 70% Real Data Intake (Real-PPO & LSTM-DNN)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Core Research Question:**\n",
    "\"Can the exact same neural architecture learn a transferable policy from an artificial world (0% real data) that matches or exceeds models trained on 70% real historical data?\"\n",
    "\n",
    "**Model Arms Evaluated (10 Independent Seeds Each):**\n",
    "1. 📈 **LSTM-DNN Baseline**: Supervised MSE Loss on 70% Real Historical Split ($30 \\times 22$ observation tensors).\n",
    "2. 🤖 **Real-Data PPO Baseline**: PPO RL on 70% Real Historical Split (Full rollout, GAE, clipped loss, and backprop).\n",
    "3. 🌌 **RAI v8.2 Zero-Shot**: Trained EXCLUSIVELY in Procedural World $W_{proc}$ (**0% Real Data Intake**).\n",
    "\n",
    "**Evaluated on Untouched 30% Out-of-Sample Real Test Data across 4 Global Domains:**\n",
    "🇮🇳 Indian Nifty 50 | 🇺🇸 US Tech | 🌍 Global Forex & Commodities | 🪙 Crypto"
   ]
